
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>위험성평가 스마트 관리자 시스템</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts (Noto Sans KR) -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
        }
        @media print {
            .no-print {
                display: none !important;
            }
            .print-only {
                display: block !important;
            }
            body {
                background: white;
                color: black;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 flex flex-col min-h-screen">

    <!-- 상단 헤더 / 네비게이션 (no-print) -->
    <header class="bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-md sticky top-0 z-50 no-print">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
                <!-- 로고 -->
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 cursor-pointer" onclick="switchTab('home')">
                    <div class="bg-amber-500 text-slate-900 p-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-xl flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
                    </div>
                    <span class="font-bold text-lg tracking-wide">세이프티Guard <span class="text-xs text-amber-400 font-normal">위험성평가 시스템</span></span>
                </div>

                <!-- 데스크탑 메뉴 -->
                <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-1">
                    <button id="nav-home" onclick="switchTab('home')" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 text-amber-400 transition-colors">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-house mr-1.5"></i> 홈
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-auto" onclick="switchTab('auto')" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 transition-colors">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles mr-1.5"></i> 위험성평가 자동화 (AI)
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-board" onclick="switchTab('board')" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 transition-colors">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-list mr-1.5"></i> 게시판 & 자료실
                    </button>
                </nav>

                <!-- 사용자 상태/알림 -->
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-sm">
                    <span class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700 hidden sm:inline-block">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear text-amber-400 mr-1"></i> 관리자(안전보건)
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 모바일 네비게이션 바 -->
        <div class="md:hidden border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-around py-2 bg-slate-900">
            <button onclick="switchTab('home')" class="text-xs text-center flex-1 py-1 text-amber-400">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-house block text-base mb-0.5"></i> 홈
            </button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('auto')" class="text-xs text-center flex-1 py-1 text-slate-400">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles block text-base mb-0.5"></i> AI 자동화
            </button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('board')" class="text-xs text-center flex-1 py-1 text-slate-400">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-list block text-base mb-0.5"></i> 게시판
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 메인 컨텐츠 영역 -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6">

        <!-- ================= PAGE 1: 홈 (대시보드) ================= -->
        <section id="page-home" class="space-y-6">
            <!-- 배너 -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-800 to-indigo-950 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-white shadow-xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between">
                <div class="space-y-3 max-w-2xl">
                    <span class="bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-medium">산업안전보건법 제36조 준수</span>
                    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight">스마트 위험성평가로 사업장의 안전을 지키세요</h1>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base">Gemini AI 기술을 활용하여 작업별 위험요인을 자동 분석하고 개선대책을 수립할 수 있습니다.</p>
                    <div class="pt-2">
                        <button onclick="switchTab('auto')" class="bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-slate-900 font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition shadow-lg flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i>
                            <span>AI 위험성평가 작성 시작하기</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-6 md:mt-0 text-7xl text-amber-400/80 hidden lg:block">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 요약 카드 4종 -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase">누적 위험성평가</p>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-1">128건</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up"></i> 이번달 +14건</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase">고위험(III등급 이상)</p>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-rose-600 mt-1">3건</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-rose-500 mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation"></i> 즉시 조치 필요</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase">개선 조치 완료율</p>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-600 mt-1">94.2%</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">목표: 90% 이상</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase">정기평가 수립 예정</p>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mt-1">D-15</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">2026년 하반기 정기평가</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 대시보드 하단 (최근 작성 + 공지사항 요약) -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <!-- 최근 평가 실시 현황 -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left text-indigo-600 mr-2"></i> 최근 실시된 위험성평가
                        </h3>
                        <button onclick="switchTab('board')" class="text-xs text-indigo-600 hover:underline">전체보기</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table class="w-full text-sm text-left text-slate-600">
                            <thead class="text-xs text-slate-700 uppercase bg-slate-50 border-b">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="px-4 py-3">작업명 / 공정</th>
                                    <th class="px-4 py-3">평가일자</th>
                                    <th class="px-4 py-3">위험도</th>
                                    <th class="px-4 py-3">상태</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                                <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-slate-900">고소작업대 활용 외벽 도장 작업</td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3">2026.08.10</td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="bg-red-100 text-red-800 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold">높음(상)</span></td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-medium">개선완료</span></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-slate-900">밀폐공간(저수조) 내부 청소 작업</td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3">2026.08.08</td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold">중간(중)</span></td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="text-amber-600 font-medium">조치중</span></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-slate-900">지게차 자재 운반 및 적재 작업</td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3">2026.08.05</td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold">중간(중)</span></td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-medium">개선완료</span></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-slate-900">사무실 문서 수거 및 배쇄 작업</td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3">2026.08.01</td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold">낮음(하)</span></td>
                                    <td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-medium">개선완료</span></td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 안전보건 공지사항 요약 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base flex items-center">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn text-amber-500 mr-2"></i> 안전보건 공지사항
                            </h3>
                            <button onclick="switchTab('board')" class="text-xs text-indigo-600 hover:underline">더보기</button>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
                            <li class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
                                <a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-600 flex justify-between items-center">
                                    <span class="truncate max-w-[200px]">하절기 온열질환 예방가이드 배포</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">08.11</span>
                                </a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
                                <a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-600 flex justify-between items-center">
                                    <span class="truncate max-w-[200px]">2026년 정기 위험성평가 교육 안내</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">08.02</span>
                                </a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
                                <a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-600 flex justify-between items-center">
                                    <span class="truncate max-w-[200px]">밀폐공간 특별 안전점검 실시</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">07.28</span>
                                </a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="pb-1">
                                <a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-600 flex justify-between items-center">
                                    <span class="truncate max-w-[200px]">신규 안전보건 관리규정 개정안</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">07.15</span>
                                </a>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 text-xs text-slate-600">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-blue-500 mr-1"></i>
                        매월 첫째 주 월요일은 <strong>전사 안전점검의 날</strong>입니다.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- ================= PAGE 2: 위험성평가 자동화 (Gemini AI) ================= -->
        <section id="page-auto" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <!-- 안내 상자 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm no-print">
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 rounded-lg text-xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">AI 기반 위험성평가표 자동 생성</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
                            평가 대상 작업명과 작업 내용을 간단히 입력하면, Gemini AI가 **유해·위험요인**, **현재 안전조치**, **위험성 수준**, **감소대책**을 자동으로 작성해 드립니다.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 입력 폼 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-4 no-print">
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 border-b pb-2">작업 정보 입력</h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">작업명 / 공정명 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                        <input type="text" id="input-task" placeholder="예: 지게차를 이용한 상하차 작업, 용접 작업 등" 
                               class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">평가 구문 및 기구</label>
                        <input type="text" id="input-tools" placeholder="예: 3톤 지게차, 안전모, 안전대 등" 
                               class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">세부 작업 내용 및 작업 환경 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                    <textarea id="input-detail" rows="3" placeholder="작업 장소, 작업 절차, 관련 작업자 인원 및 조건 등을 자유롭게 기재하세요." 
                              class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500"></textarea>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex justify-end space-x-2 pt-2">
                    <button type="button" onclick="resetAutoForm()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition">
                        초기화
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" id="btn-generate" onclick="generateAssessment()" class="px-5 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-slate-900 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold transition flex items-center space-x-2 shadow">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles"></i>
                        <span>AI 분석 및 위험성평가표 작성</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 로딩 표시기 -->
            <div id="loading-spinner" class="hidden bg-white p-12 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-center space-y-4">
                <div class="inline-block animate-spin rounded-full h-10 w-10 border-4 border-amber-500 border-t-transparent"></div>
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Gemini AI가 위험요인을 분석하고 안전대책을 수립 중입니다...</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">잠시만 기다려 주세요 (약 3~5초 소요)</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 평가 결과 및 양식 표 -->
            <div id="result-container" class="hidden bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-4">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b pb-3 no-print">
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-file-shield text-emerald-600 mr-2"></i> 위험성평가표 결과물
                    </h3>
                    <div class="flex space-x-2">
                        <button onclick="window.print()" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-800 text-white rounded text-xs font-medium hover:bg-slate-700">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-print mr-1"></i> 인쇄 / PDF 저장
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 인쇄 가능 문서 영역 -->
                <div id="printable-area" class="space-y-4 text-slate-900">
                    <div class="text-center py-2">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">위 험 성 평 가 표</h2>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 개요 정보 표 -->
                    <table class="w-full border-collapse border border-slate-400 text-xs text-center">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="border border-slate-400 bg-slate-100 p-2 w-1/6 font-bold">작업명</th>
                            <td class="border border-slate-400 p-2 w-2/6 text-left" id="res-task-name">-</td>
                            <th class="border border-slate-400 bg-slate-100 p-2 w-1/6 font-bold">평가일자</th>
                            <td class="border border-slate-400 p-2 w-2/6" id="res-date">-</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <th class="border border-slate-400 bg-slate-100 p-2 font-bold">사용 기구/장비</th>
                            <td class="border border-slate-400 p-2 text-left" id="res-tools">-</td>
                            <th class="border border-slate-400 bg-slate-100 p-2 font-bold">평가자</th>
                            <td class="border border-slate-400 p-2">관리감독자 / 안전관리자</td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>

                    <!-- 위험성평가 세부내용 표 -->
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table class="w-full border-collapse border border-slate-400 text-xs">
                            <thead>
                                <tr class="bg-slate-100 text-center font-bold">
                                    <th class="border border-slate-400 p-2 w-12">NO</th>
                                    <th class="border border-slate-400 p-2 w-1/5">세부 작업단계</th>
                                    <th class="border border-slate-400 p-2 w-1/4">유해·위험요인 (Hazard)</th>
                                    <th class="border border-slate-400 p-2 w-1/4">현재의 안전조치</th>
                                    <th class="border border-slate-400 p-2 w-16">위험성<br>(빈도x강도)</th>
                                    <th class="border border-slate-400 p-2">위험성 감소대책 (개선안)</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="res-table-body">
                                <!-- AI 생성 결과 항목 들어가는 곳 -->
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
